    "title": "Commute: Mizzou Softball keeps playoff hopes alive - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By True Deck ,\n18 hours ago Mizzou Softball had a crucial midweek matchup against Kansas City where they were able to win soundly 6-0 . The highlight of the day was a first collegiate home run for Saniya Hill who has been knocking at the door the past few games. After registering two hits in each of her past two games against Arkansas, the Texas native had a standout performance finishing 2-for-2 at the plate with a home run, three RBI and a walk. Safe to say Hill has arrived. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
